) Criterion","transliteration":"farqan"}]},{"id":5627,"verseKey":"77:5","verseNumber":5,"arabic":"فَٱلْمُلْقِيَـٰتِ ذِكْرًا","translation":"And those [angels] who deliver a message.","transliteration":"fal-mul'qiyāti dhik'ran","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077005.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,1530],[1,2,1540,2490]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"فَٱلْمُلْقِيَـٰتِ","translation":"And those who bring down","transliteration":"fal-mul'qiyāti"},{"position":2,"text":"ذِكْرًا","translation":"(the) Reminder","transliteration":"dhik'ran"}]},{"id":5628,"verseKey":"77:6","verseNumber":6,"arabic":"عُذْرًا أَوْ نُذْرًا","translation":"As justification or warning,","transliteration":"ʿudh'ran aw nudh'ran","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077006.mp3","segments":[[0,1,70,780],[1,2,790,1160],[2,3,1170,2120]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"عُذْرًا","translation":"(As) justification","transliteration":"ʿudh'ran"},{"position":2,"text":"أَوْ","translation":"or","transliteration":"aw"},{"position":3,"text":"نُذْرًا","translation":"warning","transliteration":"nudh'ran"}]},{"id":5629,"verseKey":"77:7","verseNumber":7,"arabic":"إِنَّمَا تُوعَدُونَ لَوَٰقِعٌ","translation":"Indeed, what you are promised is to occur.","transliteration":"innamā tūʿadūna lawāqiʿun","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077007.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,1490],[1,2,1500,2720],[2,3,2730,3730]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"إِنَّمَا","translation":"Indeed, what","transliteration":"innamā"},{"position":2,"text":"تُوعَدُونَ","translation":"you are promised","transliteration":"tūʿadūna"},{"position":3,"text":"لَوَٰقِعٌۭ","translation":"will surely occur","transliteration":"lawāqiʿun"}]},{"id":5630,"verseKey":"77:8","verseNumber":8,"arabic":"فَإِذَا ٱلنُّجُومُ طُمِسَتْ","translation":"So when the stars are obliterated","transliteration":"fa-idhā l-nujūmu ṭumisat","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077008.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,580],[1,2,590,1970],[2,3,1980,2850]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"فَإِذَا","translation":"So when","transliteration":"fa-idhā"},{"position":2,"text":"ٱلنُّجُومُ","translation":"the stars","transliteration":"l-nujūmu"},{"position":3,"text":"طُمِسَتْ","translation":"are obliterated","transliteration":"ṭumisat"}]},{"id":5631,"verseKey":"77:9","verseNumber":9,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ فُرِجَتْ","translation":"And when the heaven is opened","transliteration":"wa-idhā l-samāu furijat","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077009.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,500],[1,2,510,2700],[2,3,2710,3500]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَإِذَا","translation":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā"},{"position":2,"text":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ","translation":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāu"},{"position":3,"text":"فُرِجَتْ","translation":"is cleft asunder","transliteration":"furijat"}]},{"id":5632,"verseKey":"77:10","verseNumber":10,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْجِبَالُ نُسِفَتْ","translation":"And when the mountains are blown away","transliteration":"wa-idhā l-jibālu nusifat","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077010.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,530],[1,2,540,1530],[2,3,1540,2370]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَإِذَا","translation":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā"},{"position":2,"text":"ٱلْجِبَالُ","translation":"the mountains","transliteration":"l-jibālu"},{"position":3,"text":"نُسِفَتْ","translation":"are blown away","transliteration":"nusifat"}]},{"id":5633,"verseKey":"77:11","verseNumber":11,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلرُّسُلُ أُقِّتَتْ","translation":"And when the messengers' time has come...","transliteration":"wa-idhā l-rusulu uqqitat","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077011.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,510],[1,2,520,1370],[2,3,1380,2380]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَإِذَا","translation":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā"},{"position":2,"text":"ٱلرُّسُلُ","translation":"the Messengers","transliteration":"l-rusulu"},{"position":3,"text":"أُقِّتَتْ","translation":"are gathered to their appointed time","transliteration":"uqqitat"}]},{"id":5634,"verseKey":"77:12","verseNumber":12,"arabic":"لِأَىِّ يَوْمٍ أُجِّلَتْ","translation":"For what Day was it postponed?","transliteration":"li-ayyi yawmin ujjilat","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077012.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,800],[1,2,810,1620],[2,3,1630,2570]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"لِأَىِّ","translation":"For what","transliteration":"li-ayyi"},{"position":2,"text":"يَوْمٍ","translation":"Day","transliteration":"yawmin"},{"position":3,"text":"أُجِّلَتْ","translation":"are (these) postponed","transliteration":"ujjilat"}]},{"id":5635,"verseKey":"77:13","verseNumber":13,"arabic":"لِيَوْمِ ٱلْفَصْلِ","translation":"For the Day of Judgement.","transliteration":"liyawmi l-faṣli","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077013.mp3","segments":[[0,1,40,780],[1,2,790,1510]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"لِيَوْمِ","translation":"For (the) Day","transliteration":"liyawmi"},{"position":2,"text":"ٱلْفَصْلِ","translation":"(of) Judgment","transliteration":"l-faṣli"}]},{"id":5636,"verseKey":"77:14","verseNumber":14,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا يَوْمُ ٱلْفَصْلِ","translation":"And what can make you know what is the Day of Judgement?","transliteration":"wamā adrāka mā yawmu l-faṣli","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077014.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,1750],[1,2,1760,2770],[2,3,2780,3090],[3,4,3100,3750],[4,5,3760,4330]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَمَآ","translation":"And what","transliteration":"wamā"},{"position":2,"text":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","translation":"will make you know","transliteration":"adrāka"},{"position":3,"text":"مَا","translation":"what","transliteration":"mā"},{"position":4,"text":"يَوْمُ","translation":"(is the) Day","transliteration":"yawmu"},{"position":5,"text":"ٱلْفَصْلِ","translation":"(of) the Judgment","transliteration":"l-faṣli"}]},{"id":5637,"verseKey":"77:15","verseNumber":15,"arabic":"وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","translation":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","transliteration":"waylun yawma-idhin lil'mukadhibīna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/077015.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,1330],[1,2,1340,2330],[2,3,2340,5460]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَيْلٌۭ","translation":"Woe","transliteration":"waylun"},{"position":2,"text":"يَو